spans.s:
उद्-देशक, अस्, आ, अम्, illustrative, explanatory;
(अस्), m. an illustration, an example; an illustrator,
a guide; (in mathematics) a question, problem.

उद्-देश्य, अस्, आ, अम्, to be illustrated or explained;
anything to which one refers or which one has in
view; (अम्), n. the end in view, an incentive.
